        DEEP MASTERY COMPLETE

This now follows the same disciplined flow you wanted rather than mixing the categories:

> Basic → Intermediate → Advanced → Major Traps → Design → Debugging Challenges → Production → Senior/Interview → Final Mastery Test



And importantly, the later sections build on the earlier ones: you first learn the OOP mechanism, then get trapped by its edge cases, then use it in design, debug it, and finally apply it to the production-style Payment Processing System. That is also consistent with the module's own completion standard: Explain → Implement → Explain internals → Handle edge cases → Discuss trade-offs → Debug → Use in production. 
